                        {
                            "text": "Investigators concluded that the suspect had <w>premeditated</w> the entire sequence of events.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "nl": "Onderzoekers concludeerden dat de verdachte de hele reeks gebeurtenissen <w>had beraamd</w>."
